    "%lld of %lld groups. You can use the app meanwhile: what has arrived shows below." : {
      "comment" : "Groups: the first download's card, the groups that came down of those coming",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld von %lld Gruppen. Du kannst die App solange nutzen: Was schon da ist, siehst du unten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld de %2$lld grupos. Puedes usar la app mientras tanto: lo que ya llegó aparece abajo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld groupes sur %lld. Tu peux utiliser l’app en attendant : ce qui est arrivé s’affiche ci-dessous."
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld dari %lld grup. Sementara itu kamu bisa memakai aplikasi: yang sudah tiba tampil di bawah."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld di %lld gruppi. Puoi usare l’app nel frattempo: quello che è arrivato compare qui sotto."
